# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key. .env.local is git-ignored.
#
# Server-side Google Maps Platform key — used by /api/chargers (Places API New).
# This one is NEVER exposed to the browser. Recommended restrictions:
#   - Application restriction: IP addresses (your server / Vercel egress), and
#   - API restriction: "Places API (New)" only.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
